[36m(TaskRunner pid=4038243)[0m 3. **Calculate the distance Alicia travels**: Since Alicia is biking at 18 miles per hour and it takes her 1.5 hours to meet Beth, the distance Alicia travels is \(18 \times 1.5 = 27\) miles.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=4038243)[0m 
