[36m(TaskRunner pid=4058381)[0m    - The key is to use the fact that \(N \equiv a_k \pmod{k}\) for each \(k\). By knowing the values of \(a_k\) for a sufficient number of indices, Sergey can determine \(N\) modulo a sufficiently large number.
